  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8734;</mo></msup></math>&nbsp;form<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></munder><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></munder><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></munder><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>tan</mi><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Using&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>.<br />&nbsp;</p>",
